# Platform Profile

Machine-specific facts that platform-neutral skills (for example `paper-code-bootstrap`) read before running
anything. Fill in what is true for your lab or cluster; delete rows that do not apply. Keep this file out of
public repositories when it names hosts, paths, or queues: put it in a private repository's `AGENTS.md`
(as a "Compute platform" section) or in a local file you point the agent to.

